---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import LegalIdentity from '../../components/LegalIdentity.astro';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
import { breadcrumbSchema } from '../../lib/seo';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, LEGAL } from '../../data/site-config';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Privacy Policy of AliquoteIMU.it: What We Collect and Why" description="Privacy policy of AliquoteIMU.it: the IMU calculation runs in your browser, no personal data is sent, no account, no audience measurement is active, only the host’s technical logs." lang={lang} noindex={true} jsonLd={[breadcrumbSchema([{ name: 'Home', path: route('home', lang) }, { name: 'Privacy', path: route('privacy', lang) }])]} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Privacy' }]}>
  <header class="mb-6"><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-navy-900 md:text-4xl">Privacy policy</h1></header>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h2>Controller</h2>
    <LegalIdentity lang="en" />
    <h2>What we do not collect</h2>
    <p>The calculators run entirely in your browser. The comune, cadastral income, rate and other values you enter are not sent to us or anyone else, are not stored on a server and are not linked to you. There is no account, no newsletter and no form collecting personal data. If you use the share link, your inputs are written into the page address, visible only to the people you send it to.</p>
    <h2>Hosting logs</h2>
    <p>The site is hosted by {LEGAL.hosting.name}. Like any web server, the host records technical data for each request, such as the IP address, the page requested, the date and the browser type, to deliver the site and protect it from abuse. We do not use these logs to identify visitors.</p>
    <h2>Audience measurement and advertising</h2>
    <p>No audience measurement tool and no advertising script is active on the site at present. If we add one, this page and the <a href={route('cookies', lang)}>cookies page</a> will name it before it is switched on, with the data involved and how to object.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>The General Data Protection Regulation gives you rights of access, correction, erasure and objection. As explained above, we keep no data from the calculators. For any request, write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. You may complain to the Italian data protection authority (Garante per la protezione dei dati personali) or to the authority of the publisher’s country, the {LEGAL.supervisoryAuthority}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
